{"nodes": [{"id": "_github_issue_template_bug_report_bug_report_template", "label": "Bug report issue template", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/bug_report.yml", "rationale": "Defaults to labels bug + priority: medium; asks for symptom, expectation, reproduction, version and runtime so triage never has to ask twice.", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_github_issue_template_bug_report_reproduction_requirement", "label": "Minimal reproduction requirement", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/bug_report.yml", "rationale": "A required TypeScript snippet, failing test or reproducer repo that makes the bug reproducible in under 5 minutes; the pre-submit checklist asks whether it reproduces against an in-memory transport/journal to rule out a peer-dependency mismatch.", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_github_issue_template_bug_report_optional_peer_dependency_checklist", "label": "Optional peer dependency checklist", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/bug_report.yml", "rationale": "Enumerates the lazily-loaded integrations (SQLite, Cassandra, ioredis, memjs, S3, Kafka, NATS, MQTT, AMQP, gRPC, ws, Fastify/Express/Hono, Kubernetes) so a report points at the adapter that may hold the defect.", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_github_issue_template_bug_report_runtime_matrix", "label": "Runtime and runtime-version fields", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/bug_report.yml", "rationale": "Bun / Node.js / Deno / mixed plus an exact version, because the framework claims all three runtimes and many defects are runtime-shaped.", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"